  "description": "An orphan boy, named Murang, has always wanted to be a dragon rider - but people always assume the worst of him because he is a parentless. Always getting beat up for riding the village dragons, he is consistently looking for ways to climb his way into becoming a full-fledged dragon rider. Luckily, he finds an isolated dragon-egg. But would that be enough to change his life for the better? A story-tale of a dragon rider.",
